SUMMARY:Conscious Breathwork
DESCRIPTION:Event Type: Wellness\nOpen to: Members + Ticketed Guests\nTicke
 t Cost: Free for Members\, $55 for Guests\n\n*Please bring* yoga mat\, eye
  cover\, blanket\, pillow\, and anything else you need to create a comfort
 able nest. \n\nABOUT THE EVENT:\n\nWhether you are new to breathwork\, exp
 erienced\, or somewhere in between\, this workshop is for you! \n\nPotenti
 al Benefits from Breathwork: \n- Reduce stress and anxiety\n- Optimize and
  improve your physical state of being\n- Releasing patterns and stories th
 at no longer serve you\n- Safe way to achieve an altered state of consciou
 sness\n- Clarity\, peace\, calm\, flow\, love\, and so much more...\n\n\n\
 nPlease visit: www.amarsi.love/prep for details on how to prepare.\n\nInst
 ructor: Claudia Nanino\n\nPayment may be required.\n\nPublicly listed\; gu
 est eligibility and registration requirements vary. This is not an RSVP.\n
 \nhttps://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4309758
LOCATION:The Attic - Archipelago | 2345 7th Street
URL:https://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4309758
