SUMMARY:Gift Wrapping Happy Hour 
DESCRIPTION:Event Type: Social\nOpen To: Members & Guests\nTickets: Free fo
 r Members & Guests\, Come hang!\n\nABOUT THE EVENT:\n\nWe've officially pu
 rchased all our of presents for the Archipelago Holiday Gift Drive and now
  it's time to wrap them! \n\nCome prepared to show off your wrapping skill
 s\, listen to holiday tunes & sip dranks with friends.\n\nInstructor: Sydn
