SUMMARY:Archipelago Community Project
DESCRIPTION:Event Type: Community Wellness/Social\nOpen To: Members Only (t
 his includes tenants\, members\, community ambassadors\, and past members 
 who are still connected to the space)\nTickets: Free \n\nABOUT THE EVENT:\
 n\nArchipelago is a space rich with stories\, relationships\, untapped pos
 sibilities\, and humans like you! \n\nYou are invited to engage in the new
  Archipelago Community Project: it is a series of free brainstorming sessi
 ons to explore ideas and possibilities for Archipelago’s future. This di
 alogue will include intentional structure and creative prompts to bring fo
 rth collaborative conversations to help us all imagine and shape the futur
 e of Archipelago.\n\nOver the next three months\, there will be 4 various 
 opportunities to sit in a circle with one another in the Attic! \n\nThe mo
 re you want to be involved\, we encourage you to come to more than one ses
 sion\, as well as schedule a 1 to 1 with Zannah. If you only want to share
  your ideas\, try to attend at least one session.\n\nCome share your exper
 ience of this place and what you hope for it! We’re curious about what
 ’s possible\, what Archipelago could become\, and how we all want to be 
 here… together. \n\nBut we need YOU: your voice\, energy\, ideas\, and d
 reams. What we hear from YOU can help shape the next chapter of Archipelag
 o. \n\nJoin us at one or more sessions\, it’s free with an RSVP. Please 
 invite anyone who cares about this space & community! \n\nThursday Nov 19t
 h | 11am -1pm \nTuesday Dec 15th | 6:30-8:30pm \nThursday Jan 14th | 6:30-
 8:30pm \nThursday Jan 28th | 11am-1pm\n\nInstructor: Zannah Campora\n\nChe
 ck registration for access and pricing.\n\nPublicly listed\; guest eligibi
 lity and registration requirements vary. This is not an RSVP.\n\nhttps://s
 hare.fitdegree.com/?r=4373912
LOCATION:The Attic - Archipelago | 2345 7th Street
URL:https://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4373912
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
