SUMMARY:Soundularity: 360° Healing Music Journey
DESCRIPTION:Event Type: Wellness\nOpen To: Members & Ticketed Guests\nTicke
 ts: Free for Members\, $40 for Guests\n\nABOUT THE EVENT:\n\n360° Healing
  Music Journey\n\nThe 360° Healing Music Journey is an organic and electr
 onic healing-music concert facilitated by musician and sound healer Tommy 
 Dill. The experience combines therapeutic 432 Hz frequencies with ancient 
 sound healing techniques to create a nurturing\, immersive soundscape for 
 the mind\, body and spirit of the listener. All instruments are tuned to 4
 32 Hz instead of the standard 440 Hz\; these are rich\, penetrating freque
 ncies that are believed to more-precisely represent the geometric and math
 ematic structure of the universe. \n\nAll instruments are performed live a
 nd include quartz and Himalayan singing bowls\, synthesizers\, therapy har
 p\, Native American flute\, shaman drum\, handpan\, guitar\, and more. \n\
 nThe offering uses a binaural speaker configuration to create an immersive
 \, mesmerizing listening environment for the participant. The journey typi
 cally runs around 90 minutes plus a little bit of talking before and after
 . Nothing is required from the attendee other than to breathe deeply and r
 eceive the sound with intention. Sound is a natural unifier\, and it is th
 ought that intentionally directing this sound energy to areas of the body 
 and mind can promote healing and initiate deep states of consciousness.\n\
 nInstructor: Tommy Dill Music\n\nPayment may be required.\n\nPublicly list
 ed\; guest eligibility and registration requirements vary. This is not an 
 RSVP.\n\nhttps://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4344911
LOCATION:The Attic - Archipelago | 2345 7th Street
URL:https://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4344911
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
