DESCRIPTION:A free weekly gathering for changemakers\, connectors\, entrepr
 eneurs\, creatives\, and community-minded humans to COLLABORATE.\n\nWhat i
 f one day each week you stepped into a space where conversation\, collabor
 ation\, creativity\, and genuine human connection happened naturally?\n\nC
 o-Inspiring is a weekly\, open-house gathering designed to make collaborat
 ion and support more accessible. It's not a networking event nor structure
 d. It's a shared space where people come together to connect\, exchange id
 eas\, hear one another\, support one another\, and discover what unfolds. 
 WE BUILD BRIDGES.\n\nCome for 30 minutes or stay all day. Bring your curio
 sity\, a friend\, a project you're working on\, your vision\, your laptop\
 , food or drink—or simply yourself.\n\nWhen\nWednesdays | 12:30 PM – 2
 :30 PM \nDrop in anytime!\n\nWhere: Archipelago\nWe'll be hanging on the f
 irst floor\, come in the front door and we will be there to welcome you!\n
 \nWho It's For\nEveryone is welcome. Every idenity\, background\, industry
 .\nWhether you're building a business\, community or social justice moveme
 nt\, exploring a new idea\, between projects AND looking for meaningful co
 nversations\, collabative approach\, new possibilities... or creating deep
 er relationships. You belong here.\n\nWhat to Expect\n● A host to greet 
 you and introduce you to new folks\n● Real conversations about life\n●
  Co-working and collaboration\n● New friendships\n● Inspiration and fr
 esh perspectives\n● Space to both contribute and receive\, hear and be h
 eard\n● A relaxed\, come-and-go atmosphere. No agenda. No pressure. \nSt
 ay for as little or as long as you'd like.\n● Bring your own food and dr
 ink!\n● Free Wi-Fi—bring your laptop if you'd like to work\n● Free p
 arking lot.\n● Open seating on first floor\, tables or couches.\n\nOur I
 nvitation\nThis experience works because of the people who participate.\n\
 nCome willing to:\n● Be curious and open.\n● Listen deeply.\n● Respe
 ct diverse perspectives.\n● Help cultivate the kind of community you'd l
 ike to be part of.\n\nInvite a friend\, colleague\, client\, mentee\, or n
 eighbor who would appreciate a more human way to connect.\n\nWant to Help 
 Host?\nWe're looking for connectors to co-host once a month! Do you enjoy 
 welcoming people\, making introductions\, and helping others feel at home?
  If that sounds like you\, send Zannah a message\nat liberationstudio.co@g
 mail.com\n\nWe will co-create a partnership (think- cross pollinate on soc
 ial & eventbrite\, you can choose a theme and prompt if you'd like for the
  group\, and more)\n\nLet's build the kind of community many of us have be
 en looking for—together.\n\nInstructor: Zannah Campora\n\nPayment may be
  required.\n\nPublicly listed\; guest eligibility and registration require
 ments vary. This is not an RSVP.\n\nhttps://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4367180
