SUMMARY:The Balanced Soul Strategy: The Plan for Failure
DESCRIPTION:Event Type: Wellness\nOpen To: Members & Ticketed Guests\nTicke
 ts: Free for Members\, $25 for Guests\n\nABOUT THE EVENT:\n\nMid-January 
 — right about when resolutions slip. Perfect timing\, because falling of
 f was always part of the plan. Research on habits agrees: the people who k
 eep going aren't the ones who never miss\, they're the ones with a plan fo
 r the days they do. This session builds yours — so falling off never bec
 omes giving up. Nothing bad or wrong about it. This is the Plan for Failur
 e session — what keeps all eight areas moving when motivation dips.\n\n_
 \n\nEach 90-minute session stands alone — come to one\, or work through 
 the whole wheel. We pair honest self-assessment on one area of life with s
 imple guided breathing — a direct\, practical way to work with your nerv
 ous system\, which is where change actually sticks — plus a settling med
 itation and optional sharing. \n\nNo experience needed\; mats and blankets
  provided — just wear comfortable clothes and bring a pen and a journal.
  If you're pregnant or managing a heart condition\, epilepsy\, or a recent
  surgery\, mention it when you arrive: every practice has a\ngentle altern
 ative.\n\nInstructor: Sara Christine\n\nPayment may be required.\n\nPublic
 ly listed\; guest eligibility and registration requirements vary. This is 
 not an RSVP.\n\nhttps://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4197654
LOCATION:The Attic - Archipelago | 2345 7th Street
URL:https://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4197654
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
