SUMMARY:[GUEST TICKETS] Soundularity presents: Gamma Theta Electronic Sound
 bath
DESCRIPTION:Event Type: Wellness\nOpen To: Members & Ticketed Guests\nTicke
 ts: Free for Members\, $40 for Guests\n\nABOUT THE EVENT:\n\nParticipants 
 will receive brainwave-entraining sound frequencies engulfed in a tranquil
  432Hz soundbath. Using analog synthesizers\, Binaural and Bilateral beats
  are activated to slow brainwave patterns to a calming\, meditative state 
 known as Theta. Electronic synthesizers are then layered to create lush dr
 eamscapes to open the heart of the listener\, guiding them into the blissf
 ul\, performance-enhancing state known as Gamma. Research shows that resid
 ing in these brain states offer several therapeutic benefits including red
 uced stress and anxiety\, relaxed nervous system\, and improved cognitive 
 functioning/productivity.\n\n** Please bring a mat\, blankets/pillow\, eye
  mask\, and anything that will you make you feel comfortable. **\n\nInstru
 ctor: Tommy  Dill\n\nPayment may be required.\n\nPublicly listed\; guest e
 ligibility and registration requirements vary. This is not an RSVP.\n\nhtt
 ps://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4384291
LOCATION:The Attic - Archipelago | 2345 7th Street
URL:https://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4384291
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
