SUMMARY:Closer: Authentic Dating
DESCRIPTION:Event Type: Wellness/Social\nOpen To: Members & Ticketed Guests
 \nTickets: Free for the first 8 members\, $39 for guests\n\nPurchase guest
  tickets here: https://circle.gettingcloser.co/events/closer-live-event\n\
 nABOUT THE EVENT:\n\nCloser is an authentic dating membership for singles 
 who want to meet with more intention\, depth\, and courage. The platform b
 rings together live events\, dating strategy sessions\, The Authentic Dati
 ng Course\, community\, and curated matchmaking consideration to help peop
 le move beyond swipe culture and into real connection. It is for people wh
 o want dating to feel more human\, supported\, and alive.\n\nCloser’s De
 nver live events combine teaching\, guided practice\, and real-world conne
 ction time. Each gathering introduces practical skills for creating more a
 uthentic attraction\, conversation\, and intimacy\, then gives participant
 s a chance to apply those skills through facilitated exercises\, mingling\
 , and meaningful connection with other singles. The experience is structur
 ed enough to make meeting easier\, while leaving plenty of room for natura
 l chemistry and curiosity.\n\nInstructor: Ryel Kestano\, Johnny Wagner\, a
 nd Jordan Burns\n\nPayment may be required.\n\nPublicly listed\; guest eli
 gibility and registration requirements vary. This is not an RSVP.\n\nhttps
 ://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4236775
