SUMMARY:The Balanced Soul Strategy: Coming Back to Yourself
DESCRIPTION:Event Type: Wellness\nOpen To: Members & Ticketed Guests\nTicke
 ts: Free for Members\, $25 for Guests\n\nABOUT THE EVENT:\n\nWhen was the 
 last time you were actually alone with yourself — no scroll\, no podcast
 \, no to-do list? We start where everything starts: getting quiet enough t
 o notice what's actually going on with you. \n\nThis session is an honest 
 self-check — nothing to fix\, nothing bad or wrong about whatever you fi
 nd. Just the first\, most useful question: where are we now\, and where wo
 uld we like to be? On The Soul Wheel\, this is Connection to Self — one 
 of your eight areas of life.\n\n_\n\nEach 90-minute session stands alone 
 — come to one\, or work through the whole wheel. We pair honest self-ass
 essment on one area of life with simple guided breathing — a direct\, pr
 actical way to work with your nervous system\, which is where change actua
 lly sticks — plus a settling meditation and optional sharing. \n\nNo exp
 erience needed\; mats and blankets provided — just wear comfortable clot
 hes and bring a pen and a journal. If you're pregnant or managing a heart 
 condition\, epilepsy\, or a recent surgery\, mention it when you arrive: e
 very practice has a\ngentle alternative.\n\nInstructor: Sara Christine\n\n
 Payment may be required.\n\nPublicly listed\; guest eligibility and regist
 ration requirements vary. This is not an RSVP.\n\nhttps://share.fitdegree.
 com/?r=4197538
LOCATION:The Attic - Archipelago | 2345 7th Street
URL:https://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4197538
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
