SUMMARY:Dance Meets Tantra: Rendezvous
DESCRIPTION:Event Type: Wellness/Educational\nOpen To: Members & Ticketed G
 uests\nTickets: \nFree for 3 Members\, for Guests\, purchase tickets here:
 \nhttps://www.tickettailor.com/events/yosefhayim/2459660\n\nABOUT THE EVEN
 T:\n\nWhat happens when dance\, eros\, intimacy\, and ritual all meet in o
 ne space?\n\nYou live for dance spaces where your full\, raw\, unfiltered 
 expression is not only welcomed\, but celebrated.\n\nBut\, you don't just 
 want to dance alone the whole time.\nYou want to be deeply met.\nNot just 
 through physical contact - but to be truly seen\, held\, and understood.\n
 \nYou long for a dance floor with enough attunement\, trust\, and permissi
 on to allow your beautiful erotic nature to be felt and expressed.\nTo slo
 w down and feel your center.\nTo let the music touch every part of you.\nT
 o unapologetically shake dat ass and allow eros to pulse through every cel
 l in your body.\n\nAnd you need it all to hold a deeper meaning.\nNot just
  a brief encounter with pleasure and connection.\nIt needs to touch your s
 oul.\nIt needs to be a prayer that ripples out and beyond.\n\nWelcome to D
 ance Meets Tantra: Rendezvous.\n\nWhat goes down at DMT: Rendezvous?\n\nWe
  move through 3 phases over the course of the evening:\n\n1. Infuse the fi
 eld with trust\, permission\, and attunement.\nPractices to support you in
  feeling safe and courageous - to own your boundaries\, needs\, and desire
 s.\n\n2. Deepen the field with intimacy\, eros\, and play.\nRitual space t
 o welcome your authentic\, vulnerable\, messy\, sexy\, full expression.\n\
 n3. Dance the field into embodied\, interconnected aliveness.\nBring it al
 l together in deep\, soulful\, sensual\, intimate dance.\n\nWe close each 
 container with space to ground\, harvest\, and land the ship.\n\n\nOur int
 entions for these evening immersions:\n\n1. Provide an entryway for newcom
 ers into the ever-evolving world of Dance Meets Tantra.\n\n2. Create oppor
 tunities for folks already inside the DMT field to stay connected to each 
 other and the work.\n\n3. Drop into dance space that touches every part of
  us - body\, sex\, heart\, and soul.\n\nNote on Tantra:\nFor us - Tantra i
 s the practice and art of being fully alive. Our intention with Dance Meet
 s Tantra is to support people in coming into greater love\, respect and re
 lationship with themselves\, each other\, and the earth. We believe that d
 ance\, eros and tantra are fundamental aspects of being alive\, empowered\
 , and creative - so we invite various explorations in support of liberatin
 g our creativity and life force.\n\nDance Meets Tantra is a space of:\n\n
 ໑ Vulnerability: to be fully alive we need to get real. We create safer 
 spaces to compassionately own and get present to the full range of our emo
 tions\, fears\, blocks and discomfort.\n\n໑ Permission: to be the full e
 xpression of ourselves - including our sensual and erotic nature - however
  that looks.\n\n໑ Safety: boundaries\, consent\, attunement\, and self-r
 esponsibility are essential and foundational to navigating safer space tog
 ether.\n\n\nHow do I know if Dance Meets Tantra is for me?\n\n໑ You have
  read this far and are feeling excitement\n\n໑ You are an experienced ec
 static dancer and curious to explore more eros and sensuality in your prac
 tice\n\n໑ You may be experienced with tantra and want to explore how dan
 ce can enhance your practice in a profoundly beautiful and transformationa
 l container\n\n໑ You are new to the world of dance of Ecstatic Dance\, o
 r neo-Tantra and are curious to dive in!\n\n\nDuring our time together\, y
 ou will have the opportunity to:\n\n໑ Explore eros and sensuality alongs
 ide and amidst dance with the support and guidance of an attuned and power
 ful facilitation team.\n\n໑ Foster authentic connections and deep intima
 cy with self and others.\n\n໑ Unleash your creativity and learn to trust
  your body's innate wisdom.\n\n໑ Rediscover your vulnerability\, innocen
 ce and wildness in a space of trust\, permission and play!\n\n໑ Develop 
 the capacity to take responsibility for your boundaries\, desires and need
 s\, through self-attunement and clear present moment-based communication.\
 n\n໑ Discover new pathways to sensual pleasure and expanded states of co
 nsciousness.\n\n\nThis workshop is open to individuals of all experience l
 evels\, genders\, and relationship orientations. Whether you are new to Da
 nce / Ecstatic Dance and Dance Meets Tantra or have previous experience\, 
 we invite you to come with an open heart and a willingness to explore.\n\n
 \nAbout Dance Meets Tantra: \nBorn in Boulder\, CO and now traveling aroun
 d the world\, Dance Meets Tantra bridges the worlds of conscious dance\, t
 ransformational neo-tantra\, contact improv\, shadow work\, and relational
  intimacy.\n\nInstructor: Soraya Masi\, Yosef Hayim\,  & LaVina Iyana\n\nP
 ayment may be required.\n\nPublicly listed\; guest eligibility and registr
 ation requirements vary. This is not an RSVP.\n\nhttps://share.fitdegree.c
 om/?r=4340804
LOCATION:The Attic - Archipelago | 2345 7th Street
URL:https://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4340804
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
