 eamscapes to open the heart of the listener\, guiding them into the blissf
 ul\, performance-enhancing state known as Gamma. Research shows that resid
 ing in these brain states offer several therapeutic benefits including red
 uced stress and anxiety\, relaxed nervous system\, and improved cognitive 
 functioning/productivity.\n\n** Please bring a mat\, blankets/pillow\, eye
