SUMMARY:The Balanced Soul Strategy: Listening to Your Body
DESCRIPTION:Event Type: Wellness\nOpen To: Members & Ticketed Guests\nTicke
 ts: Free for Members\, $25 for Guests\n\nABOUT THE EVENT:\n\nYour body has
  been keeping notes — on your sleep\, your stress\, the rest you keep po
 stponing. This session is about actually reading them. We slow down\, brea
 the\, and practice noticing the signals your body has been sending\, witho
 ut turning it into another self-improvement project. On The Soul Wheel\, t
 his is Physical Well-being — one of your eight areas of life.\n\n_\n\nEa
 ch 90-minute session stands alone — come to one\, or work through the wh
 ole wheel. We pair honest self-assessment on one area of life with simple 
 guided breathing — a direct\, practical way to work with your nervous sy
 stem\, which is where change actually sticks — plus a settling meditatio
 n and optional sharing. \n\nNo experience needed\; mats and blankets provi
 ded — just wear comfortable clothes and bring a pen and a journal. If yo
 u're pregnant or managing a heart condition\, epilepsy\, or a recent surge
 ry\, mention it when you arrive: every practice has a\ngentle alternative.
 \n\nInstructor: Sara Christine\n\nPayment may be required.\n\nPublicly lis
 ted\; guest eligibility and registration requirements vary. This is not an
  RSVP.\n\nhttps://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4197553
LOCATION:The Attic - Archipelago | 2345 7th Street
URL:https://share.fitdegree.com/?r=4197553
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
